Added in the Wrath of the Lamb DLC for the original Binding of Isaac, the '''Double Vis''' appears similar to the normal Vis but has blood around its openings and a vertical gash in its back. They function identically to regular Vis, but they also fire a {{i|Brimstone}} beam from behind.
